config RTC_LOONGSON_LS2K0300
	bool "Loongson 2K0300 RTC driver"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_LOONGSON_LS2K0300_RTC_ENABLED
	help
	  Enable the driver for the real time clock of the Loongson 2K0300. It
	  drives the battery backed TOY ("time of year") counter, which counts
	  year/month/day/hour/minute/second with 0.1 s resolution off the
	  32.768 kHz crystal.

	  The 2K0300 RTC does not support the TOY match alarms, so the driver
	  implements the wall clock only; mainline Linux treats this variant the
	  same way (drivers/rtc/rtc-loongson.c, LOONGSON_RTC_ALARM_WORKAROUND).
